{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7346ad98c8507e877937d38a0b21e90b35d997aeb6342417c11aea572be18807f44299b8a77691383d7a04b9e507e71dd5b4235480e01ec6b044fe821f1a721dbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e947caf67f013a1000be71104e0b6a25d6306e9cd4da9cabd735bc07a472ef705ac2c02f15a4a949a5594bf42dccdd2b3e0767f7a846069653fcac636e37b01da6eada4bd989419884e8e551180a42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ae966a9e9418dc0c4255376cec3dd0e98f63c363402f80f309e667e3967e41148a3474d1d6a64ef5c48fe8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fdcb152583481798f2e07995140171ffbbcb40ec2ece777a22a932f7f0bbfa335d539cf2e07c74c3acbeb5d75c0be84496049c8c8b0c776043fc352b87ce59b7774749cda9015beaf9e68e37ce7fef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/18cc618f8bf4fb0edbf157a1db60e0ef99c64f19473a1d1aa6bf2f02d3c9fc48a290c940bfb47ef8dde5314169afea615b5b28835d18c96f340c4ddbd0c26d48df6c36b951dce7ca6e1d9928baad9e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/892fb98d95f1ce05cec772ef8d2d6442b7b014b99c3de2ccafc4ce0118e8902fde0fd96048f7a55b39706e841e3bd77ae535df4a667c756346a98847397c39cdca5ba0234933e4131625d0181bdf2f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f900f187228b11064a6726f29c3bf8174e1be47f507ed9b2bfc7a8c1993ecf0d437d984f5fb904fad9ead065a7d297e630bf4acef4c49e63a6082ba8aafab1efe900b114e00a609b48fe15a680778b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fe1eb8938877019c245cc70ef99717a6132e446be5685872f595ecca385c0b266688b3e6675f2173961cc2f935b62816b3b1c071d66f962f356ec425c5f483496ce5978172b22fb310d835142c9322\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3cb2077853e99f10a1c54fb050cb92677150d827d3a560e895d00bb31a5d61f0bb6bca022289887257537e846407d546d41b48df5adee5cb0efe745ad696653ae87bab42e6d2713aa1ee08d49c444e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8494d912200d05e3ec4b08eeddea17a3af3918cf45a81ef2b3b8918e9bd9e2884ad6a94ddfb6ecf0be0f7a27ba91343eea832ce1700c6c7b14439e30404c77670d752c3e433065ae2f1f3636f269c9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3dcfa7050c988d3469acfeeea6d5e5c1c0fdf994510ce2ff026ed825fb485a2f4c9eb48328fe5673e2b66ab8907f95e2c37479885f61493e519c07411d0d85eddb40432315edd24052315e548e59ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/313781ae9586d5be62e9ebec7e3148085cbb05d89b8cf85dda38026099c91574a61b3caddc6114e9a8cfb4181743a2f6726d0c7af126a2a35a59441eb49671bcc6e509156af42463af79cd68e02397\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fa099305323d919b3c269b4bbc19d56b40af28ece6bb7d6d8e258ecaca97db726c7fbf4ca3aee67afc0a01be93324129a2bd244d2d38a6fd74ada2dd30e8e90d4d116abc3cc32ea9e672c24ef1a544\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8b33c777d88dd6b4e3981b105a4ddfcb882c2b2e29430eff76f0573a6192b1d3ffc83fadbfc52599b9a0ed64098c371b5bc67aeb4015cde21b47da6041c49b34bc85b736ac0d3dfc3c59aef2d87f65\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a152cbb04b7609b3584a1b53a85921bbd416f860566de06024b81bf33c8724b7369e6c2eb34c2e5065ce591e266417a46567991741f17d8a32cc16011c027108a5a4d81cb1310ed7f49287ef134ed2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9f6e708283af3ef31ddee13f50bb5fa95568b92aac79b3eddd7d3f1c3a561c25765f07d8eb659114b97f2bb17029ebd54935ec7076795cdba49a1dc5c88c184a33e11e14124ec7276b75c7bb85d306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b04849b22e1a50e974ec71c301d108334983d7f113730b249d15f33d421e4b5311072835ccd2d09d8225676130fc6f64edda2bd3ad9f07511bda9a2b19f884bad183ed2658618fe4ecf72d6b22b3d3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3a993e8e2d8c7cc9d14a8538d1a3b207915fe6e9b7ec38e2a191b126085b8022595d77c342f60efdfed14613ec4ac49ea19489786b6d5434d1510a77850218207aaa60851d25b12a412699454a920e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7584c99bd67e77aa423c1ba3681f9fba0c182b27e2db00becdb770a9300334829b8813bd150dc6f4b28d9b3a596315ff89e84db65011cd23b735df80926a37ec30cb0c062437bd41910421f62b9eec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6e23b3ef70d54344db7ef2a1d16b8e16f887dca2df29b55d53273b2ffb80bb4d5dd71d6d048d0f667bfcb49d6122f15e81447d7042ead9324059ad5cdf9fbdbc6387375a5fbf1db7e490f130854788\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
